<title>SWEDEN: Swedish airports move 25 pct more cargo in Nov.</title>
<headline>Swedish airports move 25 pct more cargo in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish airports handled 15,870 tonnes of freight in November, 25 percent more than in November one year ago, the Swedish civil aviation administration</p>
<p>Luftfartsverket said on Monday.</p>
<p> SWEDISH AIRPORT ACTIVITY	     Nov		 Jan-Nov</p>
<p>					1996     1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Cargo(in tonnes)	     15,870   12,744   138,920  122,724</p>
<p> Mail (in tonnes)		2,879    2,601    28,785   24,586</p>
<p> Landings			 26,234   25,790   308,625  300,427</p>
<p> Passengers (in millions)     1.50     1.41     16.44    15.52</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
